      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `ca7cc947698aa647924dd0f41a75e38b4c9ef80142c71a36bde3dd23705c69f3--employee-earnings-and-hours-australia-2025-cube-7-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Employee Earnings and Hours, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: May 2025\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | c73b8da76f08682adf9f78f3a85c9919b68a4da3fc0a5357e62e2133742bfc82 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 21678ef2594d7d171ff7c56a983590288873930d812a514a75368b0e0c76634e | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 1984b66678e7fbaba32ecd22e9fe45674022df97aac8c1c8b870c307d79a5f58 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 3bc8017ca6bb32d558dffdefff4c2acce41900754d2a59ab785abf826b40468f | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 6bebeb95720be075779bfb3613d6b722a4c3801c66f2c6d82debde711f11bd87 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 65f99c0052423ba154fb6283d114ae6a79c7bc2c1a583902a05792d283a5bc85 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | e73b5b97706171a8a795f91ca0e2235b3c4a5822d8ec5e9843dd6e52279c3e0b | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
